WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.939
A clear retelling keeps the beginning, the important event and the ending in logical

00:00:04.939 --> 00:00:05.277
order.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.997
Kojo lost a book, searched his bag, then found it in class. What happened first?

00:00:10.997 --> 00:00:12.623
Answer: Kojo lost the book.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.973
Retell a short story in order, then invent a different ending that still makes sense.

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:21.194
Discuss why: The loss starts the sequence.
